# Saved Facebook pages, captured to debug selectors against real markup.
#
# These hold your friend list, your feed and its images — a single "Save page
# as" run left 28 MB of it in this folder. Ignored at the root so a stray
# capture can never be committed by accident; the anonymised fixtures in
# test/ are what the findings live on as.
/*.html
/*_files/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
